READING (1): if q*f_q stays bounded => f_q=O(1/q) (2nd-moment-provable arc-covering lemma).
READING (2): 0 violations => THEOREM `no small pairwise resonance mod q => witness exists`;
  then LRC(14)-compressed reduces to families WITH a small pairwise resonance at q*.
